    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 9:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hefuku damakumi ayedi nakawana dakakweji aka, anyana kaIsarela apompeli nanzala, anavwali yikeleyi, anadisukwili maseki. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.9.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.9.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 9:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asemuka kuIsarela hiyakudambula kudi enyi ejima, hiyakwimana nakwitŋia mwavulumwinuwu, nimwaluwiluwu ankakulula jawu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.9.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.9.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 9:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hiyakwimana muyididiyawu, nakutaŋa mukanda wanshimbi jaYehova Nzambi yawu, chibalu chefuku chamuchiwana; chibalu chikwawu chamuchiwana hiyakwitija, hiyakudifukula kudi Yehova Nzambi yawu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.9.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.9.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 9:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "AYeshuwa naBani, naKadimiyeli, naShebaniya, naBuni, naSherebiya, naBani, naChenani, hiyakwimanahankandaminu yawaLevi, hiyakubilela kudi Yehova Nzambi yawu nezudakola. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.9.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.9.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 9:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ALevi, aYeshuwa, naKadimiyeli, naBani, naHashabineya, naSherebiya, naHodiya, naShebaniya, naPetahiya, hiyakwila nawu, Imanenu mumukiswili Yehova Nzambi yenu wakufumisha kunyaka yejima, wakushikakunyaka yejima, nkisu. Ijina deyi dalema, datúumbakana, chakubadika nkisu yejima nikushimeka kwejima, adikiswili nkisu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.9.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.9.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 9:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eyi yeyi Yehova kanka weyi hohu; yeyi welili iwulu, iwulu damawulu, nivileŋaleŋa yawuyejima, niiseki niyuma yekalahu yejima, nituluŋalwiji niyuma yekalamu yejima, yeyi wayihembaŋa yejima. Yileŋaleŋa yamwiwulu yadifuku lapakudeyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.9.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.9.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 9:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eyi yeyi Yehova Nzambi watondeli Abarama, wamufumishili muUri wawaKaladeya, wamwinkeli ijina daAbarahama; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.9.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.9.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 9:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "wamwenimuchima windi washinshika kumesu eyi, watiyaŋeni nindi chitiyaŋenu chakwinka anyanindi ituŋa dawaKenani, nawaHiti, nawaAmori, nawaPerizi, nawaYebusi, nawaGirigashi, ninochu muwahosheli wunakopumu; muloŋaeyi waloŋa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.9.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.9.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 9:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.9.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.9.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 9:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wamweni chadiŋi nakukabawu ankakulula jetu muEjipitu; watiyilichadililuwu kuKalupalwŋi Kachinana. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.9.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.9.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 9:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wamwekesheli hadi Fwaro, nihadi ambuŋindi ejima, nihadi antu amwituŋa dindi ejima yinjikijilu nayihayamisha, muloŋa eyi welukili chadiŋi nakudinkawu wanta nawena; hiwukutiyakana niijina neyi chididi lelu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.9.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.9.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 9:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wa ambwili kalupalwŋi kwakuyawu, hiyakuhita mukachi kakaluŋalwiji, hiyakuzambuka heseki dawuma; ayihaŋili wayinatilili mumanyiŋi neyiilola mumeji aŊovu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.9.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.9.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 9:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Namwa ana wayilombweli nachishimi chevu, nawufuku nakesi, kulonda kuvitopekela munjila yakuyawu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.9.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.9.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 9:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wasulukilili nawa hampidi yaSinayi, wahosheli nawu nezu dakufuma mwiwulu, wayinkeli wuŋaji waloŋa, ninshimbi jalala, niyidika yayiwahi, nikuleja kwakuwahi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.9.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.9.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 9:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wayiilukishili sabata yeyi yajila, wayilejeli kuleja, niyidika, ninshimbi, kukanwa kakambuŋeyi Mosi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.9.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.9.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 9:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nanzala yawuwayinkeli yakudya yakufuma mwiwulu, nampwila yawu wayiidishilili meji mwilola, wayilejeli kwijila nakuheta ituŋa diwayolweleli chikasa kwiwulu, neyi, Nakayinka.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.9.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.9.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 9:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.9.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.9.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 9:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hakwila wena nawankakulula jetu elili mwakudinka wanta, achini chikili, kutiyilila muwayilejeli nehi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.9.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.9.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 9:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kwonti kwawu kwovwahila, kwanuka ŋayi haya misha yeyi yiwelili mukachi kawu nehi. Achini chikili, chadi kaŋiluwu hiyakushamu mukulumpi wawu wakuyifuntisha kuwudupu wawu; ilaŋa eyi kweyi wuNzambi waanakenaŋa, waluwi, wenzala wushona, hiwazuwaŋaswayuku, wasweja luwi, kuyileka kweyi nehi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.9.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.9.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 9:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.9.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.9.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 9:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hela tuhu, chasuŋunwinuwu mwana kaŋombi wakusuŋununa, nakwila nawu, Yeniwu diyi Nzambi yeyi wakufumishili muEjipitu, hiyakuvulo kavuloka Nzambi mweneni; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.9.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.9.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 9:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "eyi kweyi nawushona weyi wawuvulu nankashikuyilekela mwisaŋa nehi; chishimi chevu chayilombwelaŋa munjila hichafumini hewulu namwaanaku, hela chishimi chakesi chayitoŋekelaŋa, chayilejelaŋanjila yakuyawu, hichayifumini nawufukuku.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.9.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.9.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 9:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.9.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.9.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 9:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wayinkeli spiritu yeyi yayiwahi kulonda kuyilejaŋa maana, hiwayibondeli manina yeyi kukanwa kawuku, wayinkeli meji nampwila yawu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.9.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.9.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 9:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.9.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.9.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 9:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wayinkeli matuŋa awanyanta, ninyuza yawantu, hiwukuyambwila awanahawu, awa nahawu; hiwukuyinka ituŋa daSihoni, dodituŋa damwanta wakuHeshiboni, niituŋa daOgi mwanta wakuBashani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.9.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.9.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 9:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wavulishili anyanawu neyi tutumbwa twamwiwulu, hiwultuyishikŋa mwituŋa diwalejeli ankakulula jawu, neyi, Mwakeŋa ilamu nakudiheta. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.9.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.9.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 9:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Anyana hiyakwijila nakuheta ituŋa, kukuyawu hiwukuyifwomwena akwetuŋa, wowu aKenani, hiwukudihana kudi wena, hamu nawanyanta jawu ninyuza yamwituŋa kumu, kulonda akayikoŋi mwonsu mwanakepuwu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.9.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.9.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 9:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Atambwili nyikala yampwembu, niituŋa damanji, hiyakuheta nimatala enzala nayuma yejima yayiwahi, nimashima akupunda dehi, nimatempa anyivinyu, nimatempa anyi olive, ninyitondu yakudya yayivulu nankashi; hiyakudya, hiyakwikuta, hiyakutoha, hiyakuluŋa nakuwaha kweyi kwasweja.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.9.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.9.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 9:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.9.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.9.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 9:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hela chochu, ajikwili, adikaŋili naneyi, anatilili nshimbi jeyi kunyima yawu, ajahili atuprofwetu tweyi ayitotelaŋa nawu, Balumukilenu kudami. Hiyakuvuloka vuloka Nzambi mweneni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.9.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.9.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
