              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hiwukuyihana kudi akwankunyi nawu hivakuyikabisha. Chamwenuwu yihuŋu hiyakudilila kudeyi, hiwukuyitiva mwiwulu, hiwukuyinka yamwinu mwahita wushona weyiwawuvulu, hiyakuyamwinaŋa kudi akwankunvi nawu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.9.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.9.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 9:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cheliluwu ananooki dehi, afuntilili cheŋi kwila chatama kumesu eyi, nineyi hiwukuyilekela kudi ayilumbu jawu mwaka ekalaŋa anyanta jawu. Hela chochu, chafuntiluwu cheŋi nakudilila kudeyi, eyi muna mwiwuluwatiyili, wayipulwishili kakavulu mwaya wushona weyi wawuvulu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.9.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.9.28"
            ]
          }
        }
