              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hela chochu, wayiwundilili nyaka yayivulu, wayitotelumu naspirituyeyi kudi atuprofwetu tweyi, wena kwawu kushaku matu nehi, hiwukuyiha nakudi nyuza vamumatuŋa.",
          "type": "text",
