              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dichi dinu, eyi Nzambi yetu, Nzambi muneni, waŋovu, wakutiyawoma nankashi, wakakelaŋaa muwatiyapeni nimuluwi lweyi, kukabakanakwejima kunatuwani ninetu, nianyanta jetu, nitulamba twetu, nitupristu twetu, nituprofwetu twetu, niankakulula jetu, niantu eyi ejima, kufumisha hamafuku adiŋuwu anyanta jakuAshuri, nakushika kwitaŋwa dalelu, bayi wukumona kukehaku.",
          "type": "text",
